Description: Implements absorbing Markov chain models with competing risks 
    and nilpotency testing for industrial predictive maintenance. 
    Extracts transition sub-matrices Q and fundamental matrices N, 
    evaluates survival horizons, and identifies dominant failure modes 
    using engineering datasets.
